1
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,400
A sage came to Ayodhyā.

2
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:14,800
He asked what the sage wanted.

3
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,400
And before the sage
answered — he gave his word.

4
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:25,500
Whatever it was.

5
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:27,100
The sage had not said it yet.
